{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49552","headline":"何满子 二 · 毛熙震","name":"何满子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无语残妆澹薄，含羞嚲袂轻盈。\n几度香闺眠过晓，绮窗疎日微明。\n云母帐中偷惜，水精枕上初惊。\n笑靥嫩疑花拆，愁眉翠歛山横。\n相望只教添怅恨，整鬟时见纤琼。\n独倚朱扉闲立，谁知别有深情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}